---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import imgExperiencia from "../../assets/foto.jpeg";
---

<section class="relative py-20 lg:py-32 px-6 lg:px-12 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center"
  >
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative w-full flex items-center justify-center">
      <div class="relative w-full max-w-[480px] aspect-[4/5]">
        <div
          class="absolute -inset-3.5 border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/45 rounded-3xl -rotate-1 pointer-events-none"
        >
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative w-full h-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl ring-1 ring-black/5 bg-white group"
        >
          <Image
            src={imgExperiencia}
            alt="Ambiente de serenidade na Klassy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover block transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
          />
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/20 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"
          >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col items-start text-left">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"></span>
        <span
          class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[var(--cor-texto)]"
        >
          O Convite à Desaceleração
        </span>
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] text-[var(--cor-texto)] leading-tight mb-6 tracking-tight"
      >
        Tempo para <span class="italic font-normal text-[var(--cor-destaque)]"
          >si...</span
        >
      </h2>

      <div
        class="border-l-2 border-[var(--cor-secundaria)] pl-6 py-2 my-2 mb-8 max-w-xl"
      >
        <p
          class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] leading-relaxed mb-4 font-light"
        >
          Descubra o seu novo oásis de beleza e paz no coração de Valongo. Desde
          o cuidado meticuloso da manicura até às massagens revigorantes e
          tratamentos de pele, tudo foi pensado para lhe devolver calma e
          vitalidade.
        </p>
        <p
          class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] leading-relaxed font-light"
        >
          Faça uma pausa na rotina, mime-se e deixe-nos realçar a sua essência
          com a atenção que merece.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-[var(--cor-destaque)] hover:bg-[var(--cor-destaque-hover)] text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-[rgba(212,49,136,0.25)] hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <span>Agendar a Minha Visita</span>
        <span
          class="text-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
          >→</span
        >
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
